flowchart TD
    P[Pod spec: requests / limits] --> SCHED[Scheduler places by REQUESTS]
    P --> RT[Node runtime]
    RT --> CPU[CPU over limit → throttled]
    RT --> MEM[Memory over limit → OOMKilled]
    P --> QOS[QoS: Guaranteed / Burstable / BestEffort]
    QOS --> EV[Eviction order under node pressure]
